seq v=1 rig=transcript program=claude build=2.1.0
# Twin of a_turn_end_with_a_screen_step_open_only_amends, its first rig (S2).
bind 0
see busy
tx prompt v1
see prompt bash:not-read-only
tx end
expect amend t1 turn vref=v1
expect amend t1 turn vdur_ms=4200
expect tx ended=1
see busy
see idle
wait 1000
expect close t1 turn src=screen
